  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/bloodhound-shoony.webp
  Description: 'Your ancestors were famous trackers, and you carry in your blood
    that same gift of the hunt. You gain a special sense: imprecise scent with a
    range of 30 feet. This means you can use your sense of smell to determine the
    location of a creature, but it remains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden].
    In addition, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Survival checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Track]
    creatures that you have previously sensed with your scent.'
